# Catalog

- Balance and defs: `src/data/*.json` + `schema.ts`.
- New enemy/item/survivor = JSON entry. Do not add stats to `world.ts`.
- New skill effect = `SkillEffect` variant + `applyEffect` case + `knowledge/tech/catalog.md`.
- Unknown effect types must throw at load, never silently no-op.
- Items use `add` / `pct` hooks. No screen-clear or AFK-win hooks.
